On-device AI means using artificial intelligence (AI) technology that runs directly on your device, like your phone or computer, instead of relying on a separate server or cloud.  

In simple terms, it’s like having a smart assistant built right into your device, so you can get help or make decisions without needing to send your data to the internet.  

For example, you might use on-device AI to recognize your voice, identify photos, or make quick decisions about what to do based on your past behavior—all without needing to connect to the internet.  

